    "Scan of the 1977 edition of the Trout, West Virginia, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1979; field checked in 1973; photo revised in 1981; last revised in 1981; printed in 1989.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.8 x 26.7 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
